287 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The urgency to address this problem is evident due to India's demographic landscape, with over 50% of the population below the age of 25 and more than 65% below the age of 35. The majority of this population segment heavily relies on technology for various tasks. However, traditional pantry management practices, typically handled by relatives or parents through offline mediums, have left this demographic with outdated methods. Given the ongoing expansion of the mobile market and the inevitable penetration of technology into various aspects of daily life, addressing pantry management for youth now is crucial to ensure they are not left behind and to meet their evolving needs effectively.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
