/S /H3
/T (What is the value generated for the Target Segment by solving this problem? Solving this problem for the target segment, comprising 50% of users, offers significant benefits. Firstly, it alleviates the stress of remembering what to order and when, leading to a more relaxed and organized lifestyle. Additionally, it enables them to avail bulk discounts by consolidating their orders, resulting in potential cost savings)
/E (What is the value generated for the Target Segment by solving this problem? Solving this problem for the target segment, comprising 50% of users, offers significant benefits. Firstly, it alleviates the stress of remembering what to order and when, leading to a more relaxed and organized lifestyle. Additionally, it enables them to avail bulk discounts by consolidating their orders, resulting in potential cost savings)
